%% Title: MediSearch Security Access Control Flow
flowchart TB
  User[User Request] --> Identity[Authenticate Identity]
  Identity --> Token{Valid JWT or Cookie?}
  Token -->|No| Reject401[401 Unauthorized]
  Token -->|Yes| Role[Resolve Role]
  Role --> Decision{Requested Resource}
  Decision -->|Patient Data| PatientPolicy[Patient owns profile, favorites, notifications]
  Decision -->|Pharmacy Inventory| PharmacyPolicy[Pharmacy can manage own inventory and uploads]
  Decision -->|Admin Operations| AdminPolicy[Admin can manage users, drugs, pharmacies, analytics]
  PatientPolicy --> Permit[Permit]
  PharmacyPolicy --> Permit
  AdminPolicy --> Permit
  Permit --> Audit[Write API, activity, and security logs]
  Audit --> Response[Return Response]
  Role -->|Insufficient role| Reject403[403 Forbidden]
